  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Implementation Unit for Mt. Coffee Hydropower Plant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishes a project implementation unit for overseeing the rehabiliation of the Mt. Coffee Hydropower Plant. Related to agreements LBR-1033 LBR-12/0011 Rehabiliation of Mt. Coffee, LBR-1013 LBR-09/003 Management Contract for Liberia Electricity Company. Is an extension of LBR-1013 LBR-12/005.</narrative>
